  "exact_observed_result": "Manf perturbation recurrently induced Hspa5, Sdf2l1, Dnajb9, Hyou1, Pdia6, Snd1, and related ER proteostasis transcripts across caudal and subcortical neuronal classes; Atf6 perturbation stayed buffered in the same ER-stress neighborhood.",
